[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://assets/shaders/outline.gdshader" id="3_outline"]

; The building's parts are authored here rather than built in _ready(): every
; mesh, colour and offset below is inspector-editable, so the shop can be
; re-proportioned without touching shop_building.gd. The four materials are the
; same cel + ink-outline pair CelMaterials.cel() produces in code (albedo is the
; only thing that differs between them); outline_color is Tuning.C_INK.

